k-180989456/</guid></item><item><title>纽约市展览庆祝史努比对艺术和时尚的持久影响</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-new-york-city-exhibition-celebrates-snoopys-enduring-influence-on-art-and-fashion-180989455/</link><description>深受喜爱的“花生漫画”角色的许多服装和品牌合作都在新的展示中展示</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 21:22:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-new-york-city-exhibition-celebrates-snoopys-enduring-influence-on-art-and-fashion-180989455/</guid></item><item><title>经过八年的旅程，两艘宇宙飞船开始抵达内太阳系最神秘的行星水星</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/after-an-eight-year-journey-two-spacecraft-have-begun-their-arrival-to-mercury-the-inner-solar-systems-most-mysterious-planet-180989458/</link><description>欧洲航天局和日本宇宙航空研究开发机构的 BepiColombo 任务是研究我们最小的行星邻居的第三个任务</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 18:48:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/after-an-eight-year-journey-two-spacecraft-have-begun-their-arrival-to-mercury-the-inner-solar-systems-most-mysterious-planet-180989458/</guid></item><item><title>小鼠研究表明 GLP-1 减肥药可以延缓衰老并延长寿命</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/GLP-1-weight-loss-drugs-can-slow-aging-and-extend-lifespan-mouse-study-suggests-180989452/</link><description>每日注射 Ozempic 活性成分的老年雌性小鼠（相当于 60 岁女性的年龄）比未注射该药物的小鼠寿命延长约 12%</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 15:16:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/GLP-1-weight-loss-drugs-can-slow-aging-and-extend-lifespan-mouse-study-suggests-180989452/</guid></item><item><title>为什么雨水会侵蚀金属结构上的保护涂层？研究人员提出一个新想法：带电液滴</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/why-does-rain-eat-through-protective-coatings-on-metal-structures-researchers-propose-a-new-idea-electrically-charged-droplets-180989434/</link><description>长期以来，科学家们将雨水造成的损害归因于酸性物质的物理磨损和化学降解。一项新研究提供了第三种想法，可以帮助研究人员开发更耐用的涂层并保存重要物品</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 14:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/why-does-rain-eat-through-protective-coatings-on-metal-structures-researchers-propose-a-new-idea-electrically-charged-droplets-180989434/</guid></item><item><title>研究人员已经找到了如何利用地球磁场来识别古代陶器的赝品</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/researchers-determine-how-to-spot-fake-ancient-pottery-using-the-earths-magnetic-field-180989441/</link><description>几千年来，磁北极发生了变化，在构成粘土古物的矿物中留下了线索</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 11:45:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/researchers-determine-how-to-spot-fake-ancient-pottery-using-the-earths-magnetic-field-180989441/</guid></item><item><title>您的部分性格已编码在您的基因中。大量分析将特征与 1,200 多种常见遗传变异联系起来</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/part-of-your-ersonality-is-encoded-in-your-genes-huge-analysis-links-characteristics-to-more-than-1200-common-genetic-variants-180989450/</link><description>一项新的荟萃分析汇集了超过一百万人的数据，以研究 DNA 与“五大”人格特征之间的交叉：对经验的开放性、责任心、外向性、宜人性和神经质</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 11:37:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/part-of-your-ersonality-is-encoded-in-your-genes-huge-analysis-links-characteristics-to-more-than-1200-common-genetic-variants-180989450/</guid></item><item><title>科学家重现了侏罗纪昆虫失传已久的鸣叫声。聆听 1.65 亿年前的模拟音景</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/scientists-recreated-the-long-lost-chirps-of-jurassic-insects-listen-to-the-simulated-soundscape-of-165-million-years-ago-180989445/</link><description>通过人工智能和对化石翅膀的仔细建模，研究人员重现了一些已灭绝的类似螽斯的昆虫可能如何发出噪音</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 20:08:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/scientists-recreated-the-long-lost-chirps-of-jurassic-insects-listen-to-the-simulated-soundscape-of-165-million-years-ago-180989445/</guid></item><item><title>加拿大的一个湖有一个神秘的新岛。然后，它消失了——现在又回来了</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-lake-in-canada-got-a-mysterious-new-island-then-it-disappeared-and-now-its-back-180989442/</link><description>漂浮的森林出现在不列颠哥伦比亚省一个地图清晰的水库中。它的存在和消失让当地人和运营该湖的电力公司的官员感到困惑，但其他地方也存在其他类似的岛屿</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 19:15:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-lake-in-canada-got-a-mysterious-new-island-then-it-disappeared-and-now-its-back-180989442/</guid></item><item><title>土星南极周围意外出现了神秘的十边形。十边形仿佛大气中的波浪</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-mysterious-decagon-unexpectedly-appeared-around-saturns-south-pole-the-ten-sided-shape-seems-to-be-a-wave-in-the-atmosphere-180989449/</link><description>几十年前，科学家在土星北极周围发现了一个六边形。现在，最近的图像显示了地球南半球的一个十边形——它似乎是最近形成的</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 19:01:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-mysterious-decagon-unexpectedly-appeared-around-saturns-south-pole-the-ten-sided-shape-seems-to-be-a-wave-in-the-atmosphere-180989449/</guid></item><item><title>莫奈、雷诺阿和其他印象派杰作的历史宝藏预计今年秋季拍卖会拍出高达 5000 万美元的价格</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/historic-trove-of-monets-renoirs-and-other-impressionist-masterpieces-expected-to-fetch-up-to-50-million-on-auction-block-this-fall-180989448/</link><description>保罗·杜兰德-鲁尔 (Paul Durand-Ruel) 带领印象派走出默默无闻，他的私人庄园中的 60 多幅画作将被拍卖</description><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 17:16:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/historic-trove-of-monets-renoirs-and-other-impressionist-masterpieces-expected-to-fetch-up-to-50-million-on-auction-block-this-fall-180989448/</guid></item></channel></rss>